OL,4,CNine injured, three critically, after  
OL,5,CBangkok oil refinery explosion         
OL,6,GNine people have been injured after an 
OL,7,Gexplosion at an oil refinery in        
OL,8,GBangkok, authorities have said.        
OL,10,FThree of them are in critical          
OL,11,Fcondition, according to news agency    
OL,12,FAFP, which said the local hospital had 
OL,13,Frevised its earlier assessment of four.
OL,15,FA fire broke out after the blast at    
OL,16,Fthe Phra Khanong facility run by       
OL,17,Fenergy giant Bangchak Corporation in   
OL,18,Fthe east of Thailand's capital at      
OL,19,Faround 14:45 (07:45 GMT).              
